    "architecture_question": {
      "question": "在提交514fc6b3e8402e4c646d5284e97a4f0ab50a7c4b的src/flask/testing.py中，FlaskClient.session_transaction承担什么职责？请结合这个版本的实现说明它怎样处理会话与Cookie，并引用源码。",
      "status": "ok",
      "claims": 6,
      "claims_with_all_evidence_locatable": 6,
      "all_claims_valid": true,
      "claim_evidence": [
        {
          "text": "FlaskClient.session_transaction 是一个上下文管理器，用于打开会话事务，以便修改测试客户端使用的会话；离开 with 块后会话被存回。",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "Evidence:ab25dc32a9cc041b08c0989cc1c4aabdf6799e25fd677dcc18d77b67bfec94da"
          ],
          "evidence_count": 1,
          "all_code_sources": true,
          "spans_valid": true,
          "origins": [
            {
              "source_id": "SourceDocument:c06330ce6a19734de73f2c0c300f79de7c3512599c1a57823e4fc38edad37a43",
              "url": "https://github.com/pallets/flask/blob/514fc6b3e8402e4c646d5284e97a4f0ab50a7c4b/src/flask/testing.py",
              "kind": "code",
              "origin_key": "code:514fc6b3e8402e4c646d5284e97a4f0ab50a7c4b:src/flask/testing.py"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "实现上，它通过临时测试请求上下文完成：先创建 test_request_context，再把 Cookie 加入该请求的 WSGI environ，然后在该上下文中调用 session_interface.open_session 打开会话。",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "Evidence:a50a007dff6f828b5474340653a3c3cf0db94b3246f333828842e51d311961e5"
          ],
          "evidence_count": 1,
          "all_code_sources": true,
          "spans_valid": true,
          "origins": [
            {
              "source_id": "SourceDocument:c06330ce6a19734de73f2c0c300f79de7c3512599c1a57823e4fc38edad37a43",
              "url": "https://github.com/pallets/flask/blob/514fc6b3e8402e4c646d5284e97a4f0ab50a7c4b/src/flask/testing.py",
              "kind": "code",
              "origin_key": "code:514fc6b3e8402e4c646d5284e97a4f0ab50a7c4b:src/flask/testing.py"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "若会话后端未打开会话（返回 None），session_transaction 抛出 RuntimeError。",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "Evidence:24312e3e079cb5def5f8dd3b5f31a3aa0fc2b9bb87905cd70e196421db0bde6f"
          ],
          "evidence_count": 1,
          "all_code_sources": true,
          "spans_valid": true,
          "origins": [
            {
              "source_id": "SourceDocument:c06330ce6a19734de73f2c0c300f79de7c3512599c1a57823e4fc38edad37a43",
              "url": "https://github.com/pallets/flask/blob/514fc6b3e8402e4c646d5284e97a4f0ab50a7c4b/src/flask/testing.py",
              "kind": "code",
              "origin_key": "code:514fc6b3e8402e4c646d5284e97a4f0ab50a7c4b:src/flask/testing.py"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "在 yield 会话之后，若会话是 null session 则直接返回；否则在上下文中调用 session_interface.save_session 将会话保存到响应。",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "Evidence:d1dfa22e6d5a22aa36cc0dae6020f228ce86d718632d513fbbf7961a3b267b33"
          ],
          "evidence_count": 1,
          "all_code_sources": true,
          "spans_valid": true,
          "origins": [
            {
              "source_id": "SourceDocument:c06330ce6a19734de73f2c0c300f79de7c3512599c1a57823e4fc38edad37a43",
              "url": "https://github.com/pallets/flask/blob/514fc6b3e8402e4c646d5284e97a4f0ab50a7c4b/src/flask/testing.py",
              "kind": "code",
              "origin_key": "code:514fc6b3e8402e4c646d5284e97a4f0ab50a7c4b:src/flask/testing.py"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "保存后，它用响应中的 Set-Cookie 头更新客户端 Cookie，并以 ctx.request.host.partition(\":\")[0] 作为主机名。",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "Evidence:9b97ff75dc4a7e01deb6e6ba8dc30e3ce6964beb4d1ab6764b4e09bea367da67"
          ],
          "evidence_count": 1,
          "all_code_sources": true,
          "spans_valid": true,
          "origins": [
            {
